        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "-: So let's do a quick recap of this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "So what we have done is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "initially when you build this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "you will get a Maven project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "You have to make sure that you add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "this dependency for SpringMVC.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 17.55,
          "en": "Now this is SpringMVC, not Spring Boot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.55,
          "end": 19.47,
          "en": "and the version I'm going for is 6.1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.47,
          "end": 20.547,
          "en": "Now. depending upon when you're watching this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 20.547,
          "end": 22.98,
          "en": "you can try out your own version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 26.43,
          "en": "And once we do this, we can create our controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.43,
          "end": 28.71,
          "en": "So if you can see, I am creating a home controller here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 28.71,
          "end": 30.12,
          "en": "in which I have different methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 30.12,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "Of course, we are using annotations here for the mapping.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 34.59,
          "en": "But then to make this work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 34.59,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "we have to make sure that you ask your Tomcat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.14,
          "en": "because Tomcat by default have no idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 40.14,
          "end": 43.32,
          "en": "that you are using a Spring project or SpringMVC project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 43.32,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "So you have to tell, \"Hey, you know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "I want to use SpringMVC here.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "And the first controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "or the first servlet you have to interact with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 53.19,
          "en": "is a DispatcherServlet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 53.19,
          "end": 55.41,
          "en": "which is given by the Spring Framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 55.41,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "For all the requests, you have to call a DispatcherServlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 62.13,
          "en": "That's what we are doing in the web.xml file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "Now, whom we are talking to using web.xml?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "We are talking to Tomcat, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 68.85,
          "en": "So every file here is responsible for talking to something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 68.85,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "So web.xml is a way to talk to Tomcat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 74.169,
          "en": "And then when you call DispatcherServlet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 74.169,
          "end": 75.33,
          "en": "now DispatcherServlet has no idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 75.33,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "that you're using a controller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 78.06,
          "en": "Now, we have to talk to DispatcherServlet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 81.15,
          "en": "And the way you do that is using the DispatcherServlet name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "which is TELUSKO in this case, -servlet.xml.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "This is our file which will be there in the WEB-INF folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 91.11,
          "en": "In this, you have to mention that I am using annotations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 92.49000000000001,
          "en": "using annotation-config.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "And the package you will find all these classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 94.74000000000001,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "is com.telusko.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 98.25,
          "en": "And then this basically knows that, hey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 98.25,
          "end": 100.22999999999999,
          "en": "I have to look at this controller,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 100.22999999999999,
          "end": 102,
          "en": "I have to map it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 102,
          "end": 104.03999999999999,
          "en": "and then I have to call a particular page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "So like I'm calling the home method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "which is calling \"index\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 110.52000000000001,
          "en": "So DispatcherServlet has no idea what \"index\" is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 110.52000000000001,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "So I have to mention the location of Index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "and the extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 113.43,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "The way you can do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "is with the help of Internal View Resolver,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 119.46000000000001,
          "en": "which we have configured here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 119.46000000000001,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "So Internal Resource View Resolver.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 122.67,
          "en": "In which you have to mention the prefix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 122.67,
          "end": 124.74,
          "en": "that means the location of the file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 126.66,
          "en": "and the extension for the file, which is suffix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 126.66,
          "end": 128.61,
          "en": "and that is your .jsp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 128.61,
          "end": 131.04,
          "en": "And that's how the entire project is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 131.04,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "So again, you have to do this configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 135.09,
          "en": "but remember, for a big project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "you will do this configuration only once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "As you add more features, you have to do more configuration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 141.36,
          "en": "But again, remember,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 141.36,
          "end": 142.95,
          "en": "you will do this configuration only once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 142.95,
          "end": 144.32999999999998,
          "en": "for the entire project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 144.32999999999998,
          "end": 146.64,
          "en": "So is it worth building project in SpringMVC?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 148.2,
          "en": "Yes, you get more controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 148.2,
          "end": 150.39,
          "en": "And is it worth building project in Spring Boot?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 150.39,
          "end": 151.92000000000002,
          "en": "Yes, if it will save your time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 151.92000000000002,
          "end": 154.56,
          "en": "So it depends upon what kind of project you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 154.56,
          "end": 157.05,
          "en": "I have seen projects also built in normal SpringMVC,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 157.05,
          "end": 158.49,
          "en": "without Spring Boot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 158.49,
          "end": 160.8,
          "en": "But most of the projects are using Spring Boot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 160.8,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "So after this, we'll add some more features into Spring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 164.55,
          "end": 166.2,
          "en": "but with the help of Spring Boot.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
